/K [6]
>>
endobj
614 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (What happens if I stop paying the due premiums?)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
615 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is recommended that you pay all premiums for the period selected to be able to enjoy all policy benefits. However, at any stage if you stop paying premiums and it remains unpaid at the expiry of the grace period, the treatment of the policy will depend on whether the premium is discontinued during lock-in period of the policy or after it.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
