/S /P
/P 1341 0 R
/ActualText (In case of revival period ending after lock-in period, the policy will remain in Discontinuance Policy Fund till the end of revival period without any risk cover. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
621 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1342 0 R
/ActualText (In case the policyholder does not exercise the option as set out above, the policy shall continue without any risk cover and rider cover, if any, and the policy fund shall remain invested in the discontinuance fund. At the end of the lock-in period, the proceeds of the Discontinuance Policy Fund shall be paid to the policyholder and the policy shall terminate.)
